      "content": "thanks for saying that, i really hope you're right. i'm feeling a bit nauseous too which is pretty typical for my migraines. i have some sumatriptan here, do you think i should just take a dose of that and try to sleep it off? i really dont want to go to the er if i can help it, it's such a hassle.",
